# The operator-side global excludes (~/.gitignore_global) list .cursor/ and .claude/, while this
# repo TRACKS both (rules, brain, skills, commands). Re-include them here — repo .gitignore beats
# core.excludesFile — so `git add` and lint-staged re-staging of formatted files work. Local
# artefacts below stay out.
!.cursor/
!.claude/
.cursor/audit-*/

# Claude Code runtime (skills/ stays tracked)
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Local inspection scripts
_inspect.mjs
_inspect-screenshots/

# Playwright output
test-results/
playwright-report/
# Regenerated by the personal /gdocs command; never committed.
.cursor/brain/BRANCHES.md
